  "text": "Assistance Required for Updating Pharmacy Out-of-Stock Notification Preferences\n\nDear Support Team,\n\nI am writing to request guidance on managing medication substitution workflows and out-of-stock alerts within our patient management system. Earlier today, one of our physicians attempted to switch an unavailable prescription to an alternative agent, but the notification flags did not route properly to the designated pharmacy.\n\nWe have checked the provider settings and ensured that our local pharmacy directory is up to date, but the substitution messaging tabs appear greyed out on certain patient profiles. Could you please provide instructions on how our front desk and clinical staff can correctly configure these alert pathways so future notifications transmit without error?\n\nThank you for your time and assistance.\n\nSincerely,\nFront Office Coordinator"
 },
